This distribution includes software from NYU-ICL/Image-GS, pinned to
03088368d42684fb54225c981cfd94b58cc0393a, and its gsplat-derived rasterization
code from nerfstudio-project/gsplat. Image-GS retains its NYU Immersive
Computing Lab MIT notice. The inherited gsplat components retain Apache-2.0
terms; the upstream license is included in licenses/gsplat-Apache-2.0.txt.

The gsplat package is adapted here for Image-GS and Hexel rasterization.
Hexel additions and release packaging are modifications. Original upstream
copyright and license notices are preserved. Bundled GLM headers retain
third-party terms in gsplat/cuda/csrc/third_party/glm/copying.txt.
The root MIT license does not replace these inherited terms.
